[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32400200_01_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32400200_01_0001","text":"化妆师"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32400200_01_0010","text":"────啊，对了\n日花酱，这个要不要尝尝？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32400200_01_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32400200_01_0020","text":"诶……\n这个，不是超贵的那个吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32400200_01_0021","text":"化妆师"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32400200_01_0030","text":"听说是法国产的棉花糖！\n我刚才吃了，很好吃哦～？　来，请吧？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32400200_01_0040","text":"我开动了……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32400200_01_0041","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32400200_01_0050","text":"──────嗯，嗯嗯～…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32400200_01_0051","text":"化妆师"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32400200_01_0060","text":"哈哈哈，吃得真幸福啊～～～\n很好吃吧，那个。虽然一下子就化掉了────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32400200_01_0070","text":"打扰了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32400200_01_0080","text":"咦……\n怎么了，日花"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32400200_01_0081","text":"化妆师"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32400200_01_0090","text":"真可惜呢～，制作人君\n刚才的日花酱，表情超棒的哦～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32400200_01_0100","text":"是吗……\n哈哈，真想看看啊……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32400200_01_0101","text":"Motion"}]
